    domain: 'G',
    concept: 'Functional Communication Training (FCT)',
    tcoDomain: 'G  -  Behavior-Change Procedures',
    definition: 'An intervention in which the problem behavior is placed on extinction and a functionally equivalent communicative response is taught and reinforced; the replacement behavior accesses the same reinforcer that previously maintained the problem behavior.',
