        text: 'A BCBA implements a procedure for a student\'s vocal stereotypy in which the therapist provides a preferred sensory item on a fixed-time schedule every 3 minutes, regardless of the student\'s behavior, using NCR to reduce the motivating operation for stereotypy.',
